{"resource":{"id":"ml-glossary","title":"Machine Learning \u2014 Glossary","category":"AI & Data","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"12 min","pages":16,"lastUpdated":"April 2026","tags":["Machine Learning","ML","Python"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1456513080510-7bf3a84b82f8?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A friendly A\u2013Z reference of 150+ Machine Learning terms \u2014 acronyms, algorithms, libraries, metrics, and MLOps vocabulary with plain-language definitions and examples."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"how","label":"1. How to Use This Glossary"},{"id":"acronyms","label":"2. ML Acronyms"},{"id":"az","label":"3. A\u2013Z Terminology"},{"id":"algorithms","label":"4. Algorithms"},{"id":"libs","label":"5. Python Libraries"},{"id":"metrics","label":"6. Evaluation Metrics"},{"id":"dl","label":"7. Deep Learning Terms"},{"id":"mlops","label":"8. MLOps Terminology"},{"id":"stats","label":"9. Statistical Concepts"},{"id":"interview","label":"10. Interview Vocabulary"},{"id":"lookup","label":"11. Quick Lookup Index"},{"id":"revision","label":"12. Revision Sheet"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"references","label":"References"}],"related":[{"title":"Machine Learning \u2014 Reference Guide","tag":"AI & Data","time":"53 min"},{"title":"Machine Learning \u2014 Cheat Sheet","tag":"AI & Data","time":"8 min"},{"title":"Machine Learning \u2014 Frequently Asked Questions","tag":"AI & Data","time":"9 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-emerald-500/40 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"/><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\"></p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">} title=\"What you'll take away\">\n          <ul class=\"mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n            <li>Build a strong Machine Learning vocabulary.</li>\n            <li>Decode acronyms used in papers, blog posts, and interviews.</li>\n            <li>Cross-reference related terms confidently.</li>\n            <li>Prepare for interviews and certifications faster.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div></div></div></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526379095098-d400fd0bf935?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 \u2014 Concept map connecting core ML terminology across data, models, evaluation, and deployment.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"how\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. How to Use This Glossary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Skim once end-to-end for orientation, then dip in on demand.</li>\n          <li>Use browser <kbd>Ctrl/\u2318 + F</kbd> to jump to a term.</li>\n          <li>Follow <em>See also</em> cross-references to related concepts.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"acronyms\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Machine Learning Acronyms</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border/60\">\n          <table class=\"w-full text-left text-sm\">\n            <thead class=\"bg-secondary/60\"><tr><th class=\"p-2\">Acronym</th><th class=\"p-2\">Meaning</th></tr></thead>\n            <tbody class=\"[&_tr]:border-t [&_tr]:border-border/60\">\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">ML</td><td class=\"p-2\">Machine Learning</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">DL</td><td class=\"p-2\">Deep Learning</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">NN</td><td class=\"p-2\">Neural Network</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">CNN</td><td class=\"p-2\">Convolutional Neural Network</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">RNN</td><td class=\"p-2\">Recurrent Neural Network</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">LSTM</td><td class=\"p-2\">Long Short-Term Memory</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">GAN</td><td class=\"p-2\">Generative Adversarial Network</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">NLP</td><td class=\"p-2\">Natural Language Processing</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">CV</td><td class=\"p-2\">Computer Vision (or Cross-Validation)</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">RL</td><td class=\"p-2\">Reinforcement Learning</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">RLHF</td><td class=\"p-2\">RL from Human Feedback</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">AUC</td><td class=\"p-2\">Area Under Curve</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">MSE</td><td class=\"p-2\">Mean Squared Error</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">MAE</td><td class=\"p-2\">Mean Absolute Error</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">PCA</td><td class=\"p-2\">Principal Component Analysis</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">SGD</td><td class=\"p-2\">Stochastic Gradient Descent</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">XAI</td><td class=\"p-2\">Explainable AI</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"p-2\">MLOps</td><td class=\"p-2\">ML Operations</td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"az\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. A\u2013Z Terminology</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">A</h3><TermList items={A} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">B</h3><TermList items={B} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">C</h3><TermList items={C} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">D</h3><TermList items={D} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">E</h3><TermList items={E} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">F</h3><TermList items={F} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">G</h3><TermList items={G} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">H</h3><TermList items={H} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">I</h3><TermList items={I} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">J</h3><TermList items={J} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">K</h3><TermList items={K} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">L</h3><TermList items={L} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">M</h3><TermList items={M} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">N</h3><TermList items={N} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">O</h3><TermList items={O} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">P</h3><TermList items={P} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Q</h3><TermList items={Q} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">R</h3><TermList items={R} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">S</h3><TermList items={S} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">T</h3><TermList items={T} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">U</h3><TermList items={U} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">V</h3><TermList items={V} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">W</h3><TermList items={W} />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">X \u00b7 Y \u00b7 Z</h3><TermList items={XYZ} />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"algorithms\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Algorithms \u2014 Quick Definitions</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Linear Regression</strong> \u2014 fits a straight line minimising squared error.</li>\n          <li><strong>Logistic Regression</strong> \u2014 linear model + sigmoid for classification.</li>\n          <li><strong>K-Means</strong> \u2014 partition points into K clusters by nearest centroid.</li>\n          <li><strong>Naive Bayes</strong> \u2014 Bayes' rule with feature-independence assumption.</li>\n          <li><strong>Random Forest</strong> \u2014 bagged ensemble of decision trees.</li>\n          <li><strong>Gradient Boosting</strong> \u2014 sequential trees fitting residuals/gradients.</li>\n          <li><strong>Transformer</strong> \u2014 attention-based sequence model behind modern LLMs.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"libs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Python Libraries</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>NumPy</strong> \u2014 array maths.</li>\n          <li><strong>Pandas</strong> \u2014 tabular data manipulation.</li>\n          <li><strong>Scikit-learn</strong> \u2014 classic ML algorithms + Pipeline API.</li>\n          <li><strong>Matplotlib / Seaborn / Plotly</strong> \u2014 visualisation.</li>\n          <li><strong>TensorFlow / Keras</strong> \u2014 deep learning by Google.</li>\n          <li><strong>PyTorch</strong> \u2014 deep learning by Meta; research favourite.</li>\n          <li><strong>XGBoost / LightGBM / CatBoost</strong> \u2014 gradient boosting champions.</li>\n          <li><strong>Optuna</strong> \u2014 Bayesian hyperparameter optimisation.</li>\n          <li><strong>MLflow / Weights &amp; Biases</strong> \u2014 experiment tracking.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"metrics\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Evaluation Metrics</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Accuracy</strong>, <strong>Precision</strong>, <strong>Recall</strong>, <strong>F1</strong>, <strong>ROC-AUC</strong>, <strong>PR-AUC</strong> for classification.</li>\n          <li><strong>MSE</strong>, <strong>MAE</strong>, <strong>R\u00b2</strong>, <strong>MAPE</strong> for regression.</li>\n          <li><strong>NDCG</strong>, <strong>MAP</strong>, <strong>MRR</strong> for ranking.</li>\n          <li><strong>BLEU</strong>, <strong>ROUGE</strong>, <strong>METEOR</strong> for generated text.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"dl\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Deep Learning Terms</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Backpropagation</strong> \u2014 chain-rule gradient computation through the network.</li>\n          <li><strong>Attention</strong> \u2014 weighted average of a value set based on query\u2013key similarity.</li>\n          <li><strong>Transformer</strong> \u2014 stacked self-attention + feed-forward blocks.</li>\n          <li><strong>Batch Norm / Layer Norm</strong> \u2014 normalisation tricks that stabilise training.</li>\n          <li><strong>ResNet</strong> \u2014 deep CNN with skip connections.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"mlops\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. MLOps Terminology</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Model Registry</strong> \u2014 versioned store of trained models.</li>\n          <li><strong>Feature Store</strong> \u2014 offline + online feature server.</li>\n          <li><strong>Canary Deploy</strong> \u2014 send small % of traffic to a new version.</li>\n          <li><strong>Shadow Model</strong> \u2014 runs alongside production without serving users.</li>\n          <li><strong>SLO</strong> \u2014 Service Level Objective.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"stats\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Statistical Concepts</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Bias\u2013Variance</strong>, <strong>Type I/II errors</strong>, <strong>p-value</strong>, <strong>Confidence Interval</strong>.</li>\n          <li><strong>Central Limit Theorem</strong>, <strong>Law of Large Numbers</strong>.</li>\n          <li><strong>Bayes' Theorem</strong>, <strong>Prior/Posterior/Likelihood</strong>.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"interview\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Interview Vocabulary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Overfitting, underfitting, regularisation, cross-validation.</li>\n          <li>Data leakage, feature engineering, class imbalance.</li>\n          <li>ROC-AUC vs PR-AUC, calibration, threshold selection.</li>\n          <li>Bias\u2013variance trade-off, learning curves.</li>\n          <li>Deployment, monitoring, drift, retraining triggers.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"lookup\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">11. Quick Lookup Index</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Popular abbreviations you'll see in papers &amp; blogs:</p>\n        <ul class=\"grid list-disc grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-1 pl-5 sm:grid-cols-3\">\n          <li>AUC</li><li>ROC</li><li>PR</li><li>MSE</li><li>MAE</li><li>RMSE</li>\n          <li>SGD</li><li>Adam</li><li>BN</li><li>LN</li><li>NN</li><li>CNN</li>\n          <li>RNN</li><li>LSTM</li><li>GRU</li><li>GAN</li><li>VAE</li><li>SVM</li>\n          <li>RF</li><li>GBM</li><li>XGB</li><li>LGBM</li><li>CV</li><li>KFold</li>\n          <li>PCA</li><li>t-SNE</li><li>UMAP</li><li>SHAP</li><li>LIME</li><li>MLOps</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"revision\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">12. Revision Sheet \u2014 Top 150 Terms</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Use this as spaced repetition. Mark each term with a confidence score 1\u20135 weekly.</p>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Fundamentals: feature, label, dataset, split, epoch, batch, loss, gradient.</li>\n          <li>Models: linear, logistic, tree, RF, boosting, SVM, KNN, K-Means, NN, CNN, RNN, transformer.</li>\n          <li>Evaluation: accuracy, precision, recall, F1, AUC, PR-AUC, MSE, MAE, R\u00b2, cross-validation.</li>\n          <li>Regularisation: L1, L2, dropout, early stopping, data augmentation.</li>\n          <li>Tuning: grid search, random search, Bayesian optimisation, Optuna, ASHA.</li>\n          <li>Explainability: SHAP, LIME, partial dependence, permutation importance.</li>\n          <li>Data issues: leakage, imbalance, drift, missingness, outliers.</li>\n          <li>Deep learning: attention, transformer, embedding, fine-tuning, transfer learning.</li>\n          <li>MLOps: pipeline, registry, feature store, canary, monitoring, SLO, runbook.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Vocabulary compounds \u2014 knowing the words unlocks papers, docs, and interviews.</li>\n          <li>Cross-references matter more than isolated definitions.</li>\n          <li>Come back for a 10-minute skim before every interview.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>How should I memorise these terms?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Actively use them \u2014 write a sentence per term, teach it to a peer, or use flashcards (Anki).</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Do I need every acronym?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">No \u2014 start with the ones that appear in the interviews / roles you target.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>"}